# Victory Road (the original's D_01 role): the last cave before the Pokémon League, its waterfalls, boulders and
# sheer rock, and the strongest trainers in Sinnoh waiting on every ledge. A driving, heroic B-minor push: strings
# churning in sixteenths and a synth bass pumping eighths under a trumpet that sets its jaw, the horn steady beside
# it; the middle breaks into D major as the summit comes in sight, and the last stretch hammers a Neapolitan C against
# the tonic with brass and timpani before falling back to the dominant to climb again. The same by day and by night,
# like every cave. Original composition for this game.
title Victory Road
tempo 144
meter 4/4
reverb 0.3
night none

